What does this program print?

```perl
use strict;
use warnings;
use feature qw(say);
my @n = (5, 0, 7, -2, 9);
my @out;
for my $x (@n) {
    next unless $x;
    last if $x < 0;
    push @out, $x * 2;
}
say "@out";
```

What does this program print?

```perl
use strict;
use warnings;
use feature qw(say);
my @w = qw(a b c);
for my $x (@w) { $x = uc $x }
my @v = map { $_ . $_ } @w;
say "@w @v";
```

What does this program print?

```perl
use strict;
use warnings;
use feature qw(say);
sub ctx { return wantarray ? "list" : "scalar" }
my @a = ctx();
my $s = ctx();
say "$a[0] $s ", scalar(ctx());
```

What number does this program print?

```perl
use strict;
use warnings;
use feature qw(say state);
sub counter {
    state $n = 0;
    return $n += 10;
}
counter() for 1 .. 3;
say counter();
```

